# docker-visualizer

- Read-only Docker: React → Go `/api/v1` → Engine. No `POST /exec` / PTY.
- Packages: `internal/{commands,findings,snapshots,provenance,httpapi,hosts,app}`.
- i18n: `web/src/i18n` EN/RU; never translate docker cmds / entity names / API fields.
- CLI: generate+copy only (Bash|PS|CMD), risk levels on defs.
- Snapshots: sanitized, no Env/secrets; `--snapshots-dir`.
- Diagnostics: `/api/v1/diagnostics` ≠ `/system/diagnostics` (support dump).
- Tests: `go test ./internal/...`; UI `cd web && npm test && npm run build`.
- Prefer small diffs; don't rewrite working inventory/WS.
